# The API, web and backup agent images build from the repo root. Keep local build output out
# of the context: a host node_modules or obj/ copied over the container's breaks native
# binaries and restore, and makes the context hundreds of MB.
**/node_modules
**/bin
**/obj
web/dist
web/dist-ssr
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
web/tests/e2e/.auth
